  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AEF-I-P10004232-002</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FMO&#x2019;s loan of EUR 9.10 million (split equally between FMO-A and AEF) will catalyse another EUR 9.10 million from Proparco both for an 18-year tenor. In addition, a further EUR 2.06 million loan will be provided from AEF which will have a longer 20-year tenor. This financing will allow for the development, construction, operation and maintenance of a 24MWp solar farm with a total project cost of EUR 25.7 million near Tenkodogo in Burkina Faso.</narrative>
  </description>
